            "date": "Feb 4, 2026",
            "id": "5b3afc49-0071-4f41-940c-8c6286d5213c",
            "locale": "en_us",
            "response": "Thank you so much for the thoughtful review! We’re thrilled to hear you enjoyed the spacious layout, well-stocked kitchen, and the easy beach access. Those are some of our favorite features, too. We appreciate you noting the variety of sleeping spaces, as it really does make the home a great fit for groups of friends or extended families. It’s also wonderful to hear that the check-in went smoothly and that our team was responsive. We’d absolutely love to host you again and hope to welcome you back soon!",
            "user": "VrboOwner"
          }
        ],
        "text": "We had a great stay- the house is large with plenty of space to spread out. The kitchen was well stocked- far better than average for a rental home. Beach access is at the end of the block and you can see the water from the upstairs windows and balcony. It's also just a short walk into Rosemary Beach and to restaurants and shops.The bunk rooms are very small but functional, the primary suite upstairs is massive. So good for groups of friends but very different sleeping spaces! it would also work well for an extended family.Check in process was easy and the management company responsive. We hope to stay here again!",
        "themes": [
          "Liked: Cleanliness, check-in, communication, location, listing accuracy"
        ],
        "verified": true
